Package: work-timer
Version: 1.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, python3-pip, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, libnotify-bin, zenity, wmctrl, policykit-1, xdg-utils
Recommends: gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1 | gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1
Maintainer: VladimirMenshikov <vl.ai.zc.993587@gmail.com>
Description: Work Timer - system tray work time tracker
 Tray application for Linux Mint / Cinnamon that logs work sessions
 (start/pause/resume/stop) to local PostgreSQL or Supabase, shows a monthly
 report in a local web page and generates Markdown time reports.
